{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_59_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_59","textTraditional":"一、三十年，春王正月。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_59_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_59","textTraditional":"二、夏，師次于成。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_59_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_59","textTraditional":"三、秋七月，齊人降鄣。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_59_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_59","textTraditional":"鄣者何？紀之遺邑也。降之者何？取之也。取之則曷為不言取之？為桓公諱也。外取邑不書，此何以書？盡也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_59_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_59","textTraditional":"四、八月癸亥，葬紀叔姬。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_59_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_59","textTraditional":"外夫人不書葬，此何以書？隱之也。何隱爾？其國亡矣，徒葬乎叔爾。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_59_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_59","textTraditional":"五、九月庚午朔，日有食之，鼓用牲于社。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_59_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_59","textTraditional":"六、冬，公及齊侯遇于魯濟。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_59_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_59","textTraditional":"七、齊人伐山戎。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_59_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_59","textTraditional":"此齊侯也，其稱人何？貶。曷為貶？子司馬子曰：「蓋以操之為已蹙矣！」此蓋戰也，何以不言戰？春秋敵者言戰，桓公之與戎狄，驅之爾。","sentenceOrder":10}],"overrides":{}}